Data source
===========

Downloaded on 2018/05/24

HadCRUT4
--------

wget https://crudata.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/temperature/HadCRUT4-gl.dat
wget https://crudata.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/temperature/HadCRUT4-nh.dat
wget https://crudata.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/temperature/HadCRUT4-sh.dat

GISTEMP
-------

wget https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/tabledata_v3/GLB.Ts+dSST.csv
wget https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/tabledata_v3/NH.Ts+dSST.csv
wget https://data.giss.nasa.gov/gistemp/tabledata_v3/SH.Ts+dSST.csv
#--> manually commented out head lines and last (incomplete) data line

NCDC
----

wget ftp://ftp.ncdc.noaa.gov/pub/data/noaaglobaltemp/operational/timeseries/aravg.ann.land_ocean.90S.90N.v4.0.1.201804.asc
wget ftp://ftp.ncdc.noaa.gov/pub/data/noaaglobaltemp/operational/timeseries/aravg.ann.land_ocean.00N.90N.v4.0.1.201804.asc
wget ftp://ftp.ncdc.noaa.gov/pub/data/noaaglobaltemp/operational/timeseries/aravg.ann.land_ocean.90S.00N.v4.0.1.201804.asc

